OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785525522
OL,3,C100m cordon in place following 'major'
OL,4,Cgas leak in Cornwall
OL,6,FA 100m cordon is in place in Cornwall
OL,7,Ffollowing a 'major' gas leak.
OL,9,FEmergency services responded to the
OL,10,Fincident on Pengover Road in Liskeard.
OL,12,FDevon and Cornwall Police are advising
OL,13,Fpeople to not light barbecues,
OL,14,Fbonfires or any other naked flames
OL,15,Fwithin the affected area until further
OL,16,Fnotice.
OL,18,F"Please also refrain from smoking
OL,19,Foutdoors or using any equipment that
OL,20,Fmay create sparks near the incident.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
