PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1785525522
OL,3,C100m cordon in place following 'major'
OL,4,Cgas leak in Cornwall
OL,6,F"A gas leak presents a significant
OL,7,Frisk of fire and explosion.
OL,9,F"We ask all residents and visitors to
OL,10,Ffollow this advice, avoid the affected
OL,11,Farea where possible, and comply with
OL,12,Fany instructions given by emergency
OL,13,Fservice personnel."
OL,15,FCornwall Council have said that Wales
OL,16,Fand West are working to isolate the
OL,17,Fleak and that the cordon is in place
OL,18,Fas precaution.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/2
